<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 74 0 R
/T (A layered security and governance plan was prepared for the Bank Loan Application Form application, covering sign-in protection, role-based access with a least-privilege permission matrix, an access-control decision flow, secure scripting and connection practices, controlled changes through environments, and regular auditing. Threats such as unauthorised access, excess privilege, data leakage, insecure scripts, uncontrolled change and lack of traceability were matched with controls, and an administration checklist was drawn up for regular use.)
/E (A layered security and governance plan was prepared for the Bank Loan Application Form application, covering sign-in protection, role-based access with a least-privilege permission matrix, an access-control decision flow, secure scripting and connection practices, controlled changes through environments, and regular auditing. Threats such as unauthorised access, excess privilege, data leakage, insecure scripts, uncontrolled change and lack of traceability were matched with controls, and an administration checklist was drawn up for regular use.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
