<<
/Title (Input is validated on the server side of the form so wrong or missing data is rejected. Any credentials needed for an external service stay in a connection, which is set to administrators only, and values such as the interest-rate limit should be stored in a setting instead of being written inside the script. The field names and limits are assumptions for illustration, and the code is illustrative only.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 391 0 R
/Next 549 0 R
>>
