468 0 obj
<<
/Title (A layered security and governance plan was prepared for the Bank Loan Application Form application, covering sign-in protection, role-based access with a least-privilege permission matrix, an access-control decision flow, secure scripting and connection practices, controlled changes through environments, and regular auditing. Threats such as unauthorised access, excess privilege, data leakage, insecure scripts, uncontrolled change and lack of traceability were matched with controls, and an administration checklist was drawn up for regular use.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 393 0 R
/Next 469 0 R
>>
endobj
469 0 obj
<<
/Title (The exercise met its objective of designing security and governance for the application. Apart from the roles and sharing rule configured in Experiment 8, the settings were not captured as screenshots, so the record presents them as a planned configuration to be confirmed in the live application.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 393 0 R
/Prev 468 0 R
>>
